1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,231
Our navigation system guided us into a gulf beside a peninsula.

2
00:00:04,181 --> 00:00:06,261
The mainland lay nearby.

3
00:00:06,261 --> 00:00:09,204
A marine research team met us on the coast.

4
00:00:09,204 --> 00:00:13,818
We walked from a sandy beach to a stony shore, watching the tide and current.

5
00:00:13,818 --> 00:00:18,443
A brook once joined a shallow stream here, but now both were almost dry.

6
00:00:18,443 --> 00:00:21,204
We followed the old path toward the source.

7
00:00:21,204 --> 00:00:24,284
The flat ground became rough, then steep.

8
00:00:24,284 --> 00:00:27,602
A smooth pebble lay beside a nearly vertical wall.

9
00:00:27,602 --> 00:00:30,738
Two parallel tracks crossed a narrow bridge.

10
00:00:30,738 --> 00:00:33,738
Somewhere above us, the water had stopped.

